1613 [1613,false,"The carrying amount of our equity method investments was $298 million at both year-end 2025 and year-end 2024. This value exceeded our share of the book value of the investees’ net assets by $216 million at year-end 2025 and $223 million at year-end 2024, primarily due to the value that we assigned to land, contracts, and buildings owned by the investees."]
